直到你坐在第一排，你才能真正听清他们在说什么。

00:41:03.389 --> 00:41:03.889
Yeah.
是的。

00:41:03.889 --> 00:41:15.231
And it feels to me like people who watched how I met your mother and really viscerally disliked the ending, like they were in the back of the lecture hall.
在我看来，那些看过《老爸老妈浪漫史》并且发自内心地讨厌结局的人，就像是坐在阶梯教室的最后排。

00:41:15.231 --> 00:41:18.817
Like they couldn't hear the music and the poetry.
就像他们听不见音乐和诗意一样。

00:41:18.817 --> 00:41:23.939
And it feels to me like your husband's death put you in the front row.
而在我看来，你丈夫的离世把你推到了第一排。

00:41:23.939 --> 00:41:30.012
And then it made you reconsider the show because you could hear what it was, right?
然后它让你重新审视这部剧，因为你能听清它的本质了，对吧？

00:41:30.012 --> 00:41:30.512
Yeah.
对。

00:41:30.512 --> 00:41:31.012
Yeah.
对。

00:41:31.012 --> 00:41:31.817
Absolutely.
绝对是的。

00:41:31.817 --> 00:41:32.622
Absolutely.
绝对是的。

00:41:32.219 --> 00:41:36.219
Well, grief, you can't have love without grief.
悲伤，没有悲伤就没有爱。

